A server's RAM is a workspace, and it is perfectly reset every single time you reboot.

45:09.660 --> 45:12.280
A workspace is just a map without a territory.

45:12.800 --> 45:16.800
And finally, Carl Fristen's free energy principle, or active inference.

45:17.280 --> 45:20.620
This one feels like it should be the closest to Flixion's framework.

45:20.760 --> 45:21.640
It is the closest.

45:21.640 --> 45:28.040
The FEP deals with systems maintaining their boundaries by actively minimizing prediction errors

