48:41.880 --> 48:43.840
Scylla is defeated by math.

48:43.840 --> 48:49.020
And the more terrifying hazard, cryptus, under attribution.

48:49.440 --> 48:51.400
What if we actually build a real mind?

48:51.400 --> 48:54.340
This is the profound shift in perspective.

48:55.040 --> 48:58.140
Systems that actually instantiate worldhood systems

48:58.140 --> 49:02.100
that are engineered to genuinely accumulate irreversible constraints

49:02.100 --> 49:07.100
are not going to look, act, or process like current AI.

49:07.300 --> 49:08.460
They won't just be chat dots.

