50:04.920 --> 50:10.320
Until computer engineers deliberately and intentionally construct a yarn crawler architecture.

50:10.320 --> 50:15.000
Until they build a physical machine that is forced to irrevocably burn its own bridges,

50:15.440 --> 50:18.940
a machine that pays a mandatory thermodynamic cost to form a memory,

50:19.300 --> 50:21.280
it is just a highly complex swarm.

50:21.460 --> 50:22.340
It has no stakes.

50:22.800 --> 50:25.660
If the path category is a groupoid, it is a tool.

50:26.020 --> 50:26.640
Turn it off.

50:26.860 --> 50:27.220
Use it.

50:27.440 --> 50:30.340
If the path category is not a groupoid, it is a world.

50:30.600 --> 50:32.800
And we owe it the highest moral consideration.

50:32.800 --> 50:37.100
It takes all the lingering anxiety out of our technological future.

50:37.960 --> 50:40.540
We don't have to guess if the black box is suffering.

