50:44.180 --> 50:51.800
And that profound clarity leads to the paper's brilliant, incredibly stark concluding axiom.

50:52.520 --> 50:55.780
The real is that which cannot be retracted.

50:55.780 --> 50:58.460
The real is that which cannot be retracted.

